{"id":12456,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/imperative-sit-dont-talk/","parentId":540,"order":125,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"The imperative: Sit down! Don’t talk!","seo":{"title":"The imperative: Sit down! Don’t talk! - Test-English","description":"Learn how to use the imperative in this A1 Elementary grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A1Grammar_imperative-lets.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T17:49:30","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Look at the pictures and complete the sentences using an imperative in positive or negative form. Use the verbs in the box.</h5> <p class=\"textBox\">be – drink – drive – fish – smoke – <del>stop</del> – talk – turn – turn off – wash – write</p> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/imperative-exercise-1.png\" alt=\"Photos of prohibition and warning signs for A1 grammar exercise on the imperative\" width=\"500\" height=\"278\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-12506\" loading=\"lazy\"><br> &nbsp;<br> <img src=\"/media/uploads/stop.png\" alt=\"Traffic light showing red and amber lights for A1 grammar exercise on the imperative\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-12510\" loading=\"lazy\"><br> <br> <em>EXAMPLE: <span class=\"textGap\">Stop</span> the car.</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"592\"></div> <p></p>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct forms to complete the following sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"593\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Write the correct imperative form or <em>let’s + verb</em> forms to complete the following sentences. Use the same verb used in the previous sentence.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: A: ‘Let’s play tennis.’ B:’No, <span class=\"textGap\">let’s not play</span> tennis.</em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"594\"></div> <p></p>"],"explanation":"<h2>The imperative: Grammar chart</h2> <p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-18657\" src=\"/media/uploads/Imperative_form-use.jpg\" alt=\"Visual chart outlining the imperative form in English with examples of positive and negative commands and uses for offers, advice, instructions, orders, and warnings.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h2>Form</h2> <p>The form of the verb used for the imperative is the base form of the verb (=the infinitive without <em>to</em>). There is no subject.<br> The negative imperative is made with <strong>do not</strong> or <strong>don’t</strong> + infinitive (no subject).</p> <h2>Use</h2> <p>You can use the imperative to:</p> <h4>Give instructions</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>Open</strong></span> the package carefully.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Connect</strong></span> the cable to the plug.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Give orders</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>Fasten</strong></span> your seatbelt.</em></li> <li><em><strong><span>Stop</span></strong> talking!</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Run</strong></span>!</em></li> </ul> <h4>Offer something or invite someone to something</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>Have</strong></span> some cookies.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Come</strong></span> and <span><strong>sit</strong></span> with us.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Give advice</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>Get</strong></span> some sleep.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Tell</strong></span> her how you feel.</em></li> <li><em><span><strong>Go</strong></span> and <span><strong>have</strong></span> fun.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Give warnings</h4> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em><span><strong>Don’t touch</strong></span> that cable.</em></li> <li><em>Please, <span><strong>Stop </strong></span>the car!</em></li> </ul> <h3>Let’s</h3> <h4>Make suggestions</h4> <p>You can use the form <strong>let’s </strong>+ verb or <strong>let’s not </strong>+ verb to make suggestions.<br> <br> <strong>(+)</strong> <em> It’s very hot today. <strong><span>Let’s go</span></strong> to the swimming pool.</em><br> <strong>(-)</strong> <em><span><strong>Let’s not go out</strong></span> today. I’m very tired.</em></p>","quizzes":[{"id":592,"questions":[{"id":5059,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Please, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5060,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> in this area.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5061,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your mobile phone.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5062,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> right.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5063,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Please, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> in this area.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5064,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your name here.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5065,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> careful. The floor is wet.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5066,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> your hands.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5067,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> slowly.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5068,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> this water.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]},{"id":593,"questions":[{"id":5069,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ to the cinema. There is a good film today.</div>","choices":[{"id":8019,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>You go</span>"},{"id":8020,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Don't go</span>"},{"id":8021,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Let's go</span>"}]},{"id":5070,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ candy. It's bad for your teeth. </div>","choices":[{"id":8022,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>You don't eat</span>"},{"id":8023,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Let's eat</span>"},{"id":8024,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Don't eat</span>"}]},{"id":5071,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ to the party. I'm very tired and I want to go to bed.</div>","choices":[{"id":8025,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Let's don't go</span>"},{"id":8026,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>You don't go</span>"},{"id":8027,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Let's not go</span>"}]},{"id":5072,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ here, please. </div>","choices":[{"id":8028,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Come</span>"},{"id":8029,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>You come</span>"},{"id":8030,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Let's come</span>"}]},{"id":5073,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ this book. It's horrible.</div>","choices":[{"id":8031,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Let's read</span>"},{"id":8032,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Don't read</span>"},{"id":8033,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>You don't read</span>"}]},{"id":5074,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ the window, please. It's very cold outside. </div>","choices":[{"id":8034,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>You don't open</span>"},{"id":8035,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Open</span>"},{"id":8036,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Don't open</span>"}]},{"id":5075,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ the light, please. It's very dark. </div>","choices":[{"id":8037,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Let's turn on</span>"},{"id":8038,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Don't turn</span>"},{"id":8039,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Turn on</span>"}]},{"id":5076,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>_____ sad for me. I'm OK.</div>","choices":[{"id":8040,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Aren't</span>"},{"id":8041,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Don't be</span>"},{"id":8042,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>You not be</span>"}]},{"id":5077,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The fridge is empty. _____ to a restaurant today. </div>","choices":[{"id":8043,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Let's go</span>"},{"id":8044,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>You go</span>"},{"id":8045,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Don't go</span>"}]},{"id":5078,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>A: '_____ a piece of cake.' B: 'Thanks.'</div>","choices":[{"id":8046,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Let's have</span>"},{"id":8047,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>Have</span>"},{"id":8048,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>Don't have</span>"}]}]},{"id":594,"questions":[{"id":5079,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I'll turn off the TV.' B: 'No, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the TV, please. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5080,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I'll call you this evening.' B: 'Yes, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> me this evening, please.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5081,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'Do you want to listen to music.' B: 'Yes, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to music.' </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5082,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'Let's go to the cinema.' B: 'No, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to the cinema. Let's stay home and watch TV.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5083,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I will wake you up at 7.' B: 'No, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> me up at 7. It's too early.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5084,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I will clean the fridge.' B: 'Yes, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the fridge, please. It's very dirty. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5085,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I will open a bottle of wine.' B: 'No, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a bottle of wine, please. I prefer beer.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5086,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'Would you like to have a picnic in the park?' B: 'Yes, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a picnic in the park. What a great idea!'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5087,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'I will order some pizza.' B:'Yes, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> some pizza, please. I am too tired to cook. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5088,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>A: 'Do you want to talk about work?' B: 'No, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> about work. Let's talk about something different.'</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}